actually it should be fairly simple, noeGNUd makes no changes to NetHack 
itself. it's purely a GUI, the only source changes to nethack are 
defines and the like much like there are #define TTY or #define X11 i 
just used #define NOEGNUD.

the next generation noeGNUd build system actually allows for custom 
patches to be streamlined into the auto-build. as this is one of the 
most often requested "features" of the veteran players.

as far as the windows version goes, i was under the impression most 
windows users dont wish to compile it themselves so i release it binary 
only.

no one has ever asked me for the win32 diff files so they could build it 
